


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_3eecc482:


    "阳菜和圣夜子来到宿管房间。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_365b6ddc:


    "阳菜打开桌子上的电脑，把光盘放到光驱里之后，连上了随身听。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_a80224ff:


    "阳菜她们住的屋里没有电脑，所以想往随身听里拷贝新的歌曲时都是来宿管室这里借电脑用。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_c5d71dbc:



    voice "2HI_0888"
    hina "「祥子，我用哪个软件才能拷？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_675bcfdb:



    voice "2SA_0696"
    sachiko "「伦应该安装了专门拷歌的软件。啊这个就是」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_f48911a2:


    "点开一个音符图标的软件后，电脑开始自动读取光盘信息。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_622a96d6:



    voice "2SA_0697"
    sachiko "「然后按照软件提示，到时候更换碟子就行了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_860a8806:



    voice "2HI_0889"
    hina "「嗯，谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_1eeb62e7:



    voice "2SA_0698"
    sachiko "「你还是总听些完全不是这个年代的歌啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_636d1680:


    "祥子这么说着，从一叠光盘盒里拿出一张来。其他的光盘也都是八九十年代的外文歌。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_4388e6a8:



    voice "2HI_0890"
    hina "「都是我爸推荐的，随身听也还有很大空间放，就在新年时一起借过来拷了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_251b6c6d:



    voice "2MI_0834"
    miyako "「上面写的是美元，进口货？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_5d9cb034:



    voice "2HI_0891"
    hina "「不是，是在美国当地买的，我爸爸年轻时几乎都在国外待着，英语溜着呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_29727794:



    voice "2MI_0835"
    miyako "「嘿～这么厉害呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_6d89d5f7:


    "有这样的爸爸却不会英语的阳菜也是很厉害。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_e39a5622:



    voice "2SA_0699"
    sachiko "「你天天净听些这么老的歌，和周围人有的聊吗？去卡拉OK时都唱些什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_8510797c:



    voice "2HI_0892"
    hina "「哎，就唱这类的啊？我唱给你听——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_8bc0200c:



    voice "2SA_0700"
    sachiko "「不用」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_cfe07f9d:


    "脱口而出的拒绝。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_0790096c:



    voice "2HI_0893"
    hina "「好过分」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_b6d08be0:



    voice "2MI_0836"
    miyako "「我喜欢阳菜的歌声。有种充满野性的感觉」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_09bdcc08:


    "嚎叫的声音？"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_531f2bfe:



    voice "2HI_0894"
    hina "「圣夜子应该会喜欢摇滚」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_7ff873ea:



    voice "2SA_0701"
    sachiko "「啊对了，这个和这个还有这个以及这个文件夹不要打开喔」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_986c3eea:



    voice "2HI_0895"
    hina "「好多啊！而且这不已经是桌面上所有的了吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_10290bc4:



    voice "2MI_0837"
    miyako "「里面都放了什么？名字都是『amazing!』『spectacle!』『fantastic!』之类的，感觉好厉害」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_aea95483:



    voice "2SA_0702"
    sachiko "「打开看倒没什么，但阳菜肯定会暴怒」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_255c90d3:



    voice "2HI_0896"
    hina "「我不打开。也就这张壁纸是正经的吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_a14acd98:


    "没错，桌面壁纸很意外的竟还是默认的那个。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_6cdce17c:



    voice "2SA_0703"
    sachiko "「肯定啊，这个电脑工作上会用，平时开会也会带过去的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_99adcb43:



    voice "2HI_0897"
    hina "「工作用的还放这些！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_bbea7955:


    "咯嗒。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_a0450d2a:



    voice "2MI_0838"
    miyako "「哇啊，好多裸体的女人～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_13332fc7:



    voice "2HI_0898"
    hina "「而且还能打开……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_d1d228ca:


    "在阳菜把歌都拷好后，圣夜子把『amazing!』、『spectacle!』等等一个个打开了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_12c77d57:



    voice "2SA_0704"
    sachiko "「好玩吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_ecec2735:



    voice "2MI_0839"
    miyako "「不知道，总之把它们全部都打开！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_ba557f86:


    "面对数量如此之多的文件夹，她已经不去考虑要打开哪个了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_af63cb29:



    voice "2SA_0705"
    sachiko "「那你可要一直开到早上咯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_fdd330a7:



    voice "2HI_0899"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_e74d9693:


    "拿着光碟到床边收拾的阳菜抬起头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_26c28f3b:



    voice "2HI_0900"
    hina "「……呐，祥子」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_fdfc80d0:



    voice "2SA_0706"
    sachiko "「嗯、好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_27760d17:


    "祥子有些吓到的转身看去。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_e7558150:



    voice "2HI_0901"
    hina "「我有事想问你」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_60a0d8a1:



    voice "2SA_0707"
    sachiko "「不是为这些色情的东西凶我吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_369eb15f:



    voice "2HI_0902"
    hina "「倒不会生气……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_4cc9109c:


    "稍微有点不好开口。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_219a1f57:



    voice "2HI_0903"
    hina "「祥子有和谁H过吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_2953ed0d:



    voice "2SA_0708"
    sachiko "「唔噗！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_f3d0fdaa:


    "祥子被突然的问题惊到。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_eb989b68:



    voice "2SA_0709"
    sachiko "「……难道是在暗示我？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_8f223600:



    voice "2HI_0904"
    hina "「暗示个头！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_019c16b0:



    voice "2SA_0710"
    sachiko "「嘎呼」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_484373a8:


    "阳菜丢过来的枕头正中祥子的脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_afa04607:



    voice "2HI_0905"
    hina "「圣夜子有过吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_804acc15:



    voice "2MI_0840"
    miyako "「还没有～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_94c19642:


    "就算被直接问到依然可以正常运转的圣夜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_0f401127:



    voice "2MI_0841"
    miyako "「怎么突然问这个？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_20bcd2d6:


    "不过倒是知道这不太像是阳菜会问的问题。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_c962059f:



    voice "2HI_0906"
    hina "「我不知道该怎么和小文做」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_64916bfc:



    voice "2MI_0842"
    miyako "「不是都做过很多次了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_18da7dc2:



    voice "2HI_0907"
    hina "「是做过了……但是做得不够好，我想让小文舒服」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_42e35673:



    voice "2MI_0843"
    miyako "「原来如此～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_0fc1f077:


    "两人如此直接的对话让祥子困惑了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_ffccd901:



    voice "2HI_0908"
    hina "「祥子应该很熟悉这类事情吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_bb908ebc:


    "很自然的问过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_35f8a4d2:



    voice "2SA_0711"
    sachiko "「当、当然！你想问什么尽管问！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_106ff35d:



    voice "2HI_0909"
    hina "「谢谢，有一堆想问的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_62f175d5:



    voice "2MI_0844"
    miyako "「我也很感兴趣」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_d4f074c8:



    voice "2SA_0712"
    sachiko "「那个、呃……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_faca933d:


    "——此时。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_0ea0b913:



    voice "2FU_0741"
    fumi "「绪方，有空聊一下吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_8f365b2c:


    "文把茶放到桌上后，正坐好。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_d695e790:



    voice "2RI_0874"
    rin "「嗯，什么事？怎么突然这么正式？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_30bba151:


    "看到文严肃的表情，躺在桌下的伦撑起身子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_ff7613a1:



    voice "2FU_0742"
    fumi "「我想了好久后，决定找你问这个事情」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_bb7a6df9:



    voice "2RI_0875"
    rin "「好的，虽然不知什么让你想了那么久，不过只要是我力所能及的都会帮你的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_7da6e39c:



    voice "2FU_0743"
    fumi "「谢谢，那个，其实——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_48afdcc7:



    voice "2RI_0876"
    rin "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_9ff1dc06:


    "伦喝了口茶等文的下文。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_26fc3371:



    voice "2FU_0744"
    fumi "「请教我怎么做爱！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_f378132c:



    voice "2RI_0877"
    rin "「噗噗噢！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_1757145e:


    "嘴里含着的茶全都喷了出来，手上拿着的茶也全都撒了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_d8429649:



    voice "2FU_0745"
    fumi "「运动裤换一下会好些，我拿去洗，快脱下来」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_1698cbf0:



    voice "2RI_0878"
    rin "「啊，好的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_323d48e5:


    "伦听话的站起身来脱下裤子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_bb15f42b:



    voice "2RI_0879"
    rin "「还好睡衣没弄到」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_f4ee291d:



    voice "2FU_0746"
    fumi "「……是呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_78e9a1d2:


    "文笑着从伦手上接过脱下来的裤子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_e7f315e8:



    voice "2FU_0747"
    fumi "「还有换的裤子穿吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_b2603636:



    voice "2RI_0880"
    rin "「有的，别担心，不过吓死我了，没想到会被你问这种事情」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_e2593c1a:



    voice "2FU_0748"
    fumi "「对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_64603734:



    voice "2RI_0881"
    rin "「没事，只是没想到会从浅生嘴里听到“做爱”这个词」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_fd9da2ec:



    voice "2FU_0749"
    fumi "「对不起对不起对不起！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_7d8911f3:



    voice "2RI_0882"
    rin "「不过怎么突然问这个？啊，难道是在暗示我？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_af5ac3dd:



    voice "2FU_0750"
    fumi "「不是，不是！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_063b905a:



    voice "2RI_0883"
    rin "「啊哈哈，开玩笑，是和阳菜吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_dcc75297:



    voice "2FU_0751"
    fumi "「……是，一直都不知该怎么办才好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_7c491c28:



    voice "2RI_0884"
    rin "「哎，难道是不想和阳菜做？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_316ab120:



    voice "2FU_0752"
    fumi "「不是！是想做得更多！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_33695798:



    voice "2RI_0885"
    rin "「哦、噢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_256f7a43:



    voice "2FU_0753"
    fumi "「但是我们俩不太懂怎么做……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_229f51d2:



    voice "2FU_0754"
    fumi "「当然阳菜已经努力进行过各种尝试了，所以我想我也该做些什么吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_b8f2da3e:



    voice "2FU_0755"
    fumi "「想着你应该会比较了解，就来问了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_66921fc0:



    voice "2RI_0886"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_889ef3d3:


    "虚无的表情。没错，这简直是场『酷刑』。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_ed29c954:



    voice "2RI_0887"
    rin "「不是，那个……比较了解什么的……我完全没做过啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_7647c447:



    voice "2HI_0910"
    hina "「我回来了小文，还带了祥子姐来——啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_f2bcdf64:



    voice "2RI_0888"
    rin "「啊，回来啦——哎？啊！不、不是，你误会了！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_c616cc8d:



    voice "2HI_0911"
    hina "「喂———！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_55703cf5:



    voice "2RI_0889"
    rin "「啊好痛。刚才开始就一直好惨呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_fa2404f8:


    "伦揉着脸说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_a7ac7b91:



    voice "2SA_0713"
    sachiko "「这不赖阳菜，谁看到光着下半身想要袭击自己女朋友的人都会直接上去死磕的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_9deae30d:



    voice "2RI_0890B"
    rin "「所以我只是茶刚好撒到身上在换衣服而已！什么光着！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_a29516c2:


    "现在已经不是光着了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_5e7f535f:



    voice "2SA_0714"
    sachiko "「先不提这个，我们怎么办啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_1e37e6e1:


    "把阳菜两人留在隔壁，两人在这里秘密讨论的话题肯定就是……"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_0f1a6239:



    voice "2RI_0891B"
    rin "「现实中被要求教她做爱也不知道怎么教啊，我只是个幻想世界的居民」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_f9ea6b36:



    voice "2SA_0715"
    sachiko "「我可是被阳菜非常直白的问了好多呢，她完全没自觉，反而弄得我很有罪恶感」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_013fb77f:



    voice "2RI_0892"
    rin "「呜哇，我懂」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_0754490e:



    voice "2SA_0716"
    sachiko "「总之我们要不要说些具体的建议给她俩呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_5fb8eb54:



    voice "2RI_0893"
    rin "「宛如天使般纯洁的我肯定说不出来什么啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_6734c5f7:



    voice "2SA_0717"
    sachiko "「你只是身体还纯洁着。不过被两个小白问的我们也完全没有经验，只会嘴上说说嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_4e595920:



    voice "2RI_0894"
    rin "「虽然不是很明白，但感觉完全中枪了，真不甘心……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_dceca4d0:


    "一次笨拙的实践比一百次华丽的纸上谈兵强。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_a7e732aa:



    voice "2RI_0895"
    rin "「那果然这事还是交给经验丰富的祥子老师吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_1ea822ed:



    voice "2SA_0718"
    sachiko "「啊，你好狡猾」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_d5e91298:



    voice "2RI_0896"
    rin "「哎，难道没有经验吗？明明一直以来都是一副色情权威代表的样子！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_44a6ff22:



    voice "2SA_0719"
    sachiko "「才、才没有！有的！我有好多次经验呢！身经百战！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_0cd6588c:


    "呵呵呵。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_057897af:



    voice "2SA_0720"
    sachiko "「但是就算说教给她们，也不知道要说什么啊？前戏之类的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_10c4daaa:



    voice "2RI_0897"
    rin "「掰开紧紧闭合的双腿，把脸凑近私密的裂缝，那里已经流出了滚烫的蜜液……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_67c7b551:


    rin_sachiko "「呀啊——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_357b0061:


    "两人双手捂脸叫道。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_87dffe9d:



    voice "2MI_0845"
    miyako "「只要爱着对方，互相说出心中所想，自然就会找到适合两人的做法吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_40fada72:


    rin_sachiko "「呜哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_c270aa3e:


    "在两人瞎闹时，圣夜子插进话来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_d1bd283a:



    voice "2MI_0846"
    miyako "「想着你们俩怎么那么慢就过来看看」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_5eebdb7d:



    voice "2SA_0723"
    sachiko "「啊，那个……现在就过去」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_ef5d2e3d:



    voice "2SA_0724"
    sachiko "「只要爱着对方，互相说出心中所想——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_37e4dc47:



    voice "2RI_0900"
    rin "「哇，照搬！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_04_f830b1ae:



    voice "2SA_0725"
    sachiko "「你闭嘴安静会。自然就会找到适合两人的做法吧？」"


